Subject: [PATCH 07682/11362] [outer-loop] fix _run_arm signature (goal_verify
 kwarg) -- v4 crashed on the missing param

Prior driver patch added goal_verify to the _run_arm CALLS but ruff
had reflowed the signature to multi-line so the string-replace missed
it; the v4 run crashed immediately (TypeError) before writing, so no
data lost. Signature now accepts goal_verify.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
